    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f013e05da578ef1f8555c900",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然不能百分之百确定，\n但我还是把身为训练员的想法告诉她。\n今年夏天我确实看到了北部玄驹的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1993cdd3b485d2adbe65afb3ef41397e4b2d491f73249eee29bccd92b77064c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
