      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "体格、身段，以及脚步。\n从各个角度去评估都让我觉得她适合跑长距离。\n除此之外──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5a94e4108cc893aa92584e56907126cb34337965fa9388845286c64ece6945e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
